   },
   "intro": "At the rest stop, a man in a raincoat is eating noodles at your table without asking.\n\nLooker: \"Don't look up. You've been followed by something for a stage. Not a person. The sky went the wrong colour behind you twice. You didn't notice. It did.\"\n\nAnabel, sitting down on his other side: \"He means it's coming. We run a task force. It's two people and one office with a leak.\" She slides a Beast Ball across the table. \"We have one of these. You can have it.\"",
   "choices": [
    {
     "label": "\"Why me?\"",
     "success": {
      "text": "Anabel: \"Because of how you fight. They're drawn to it.\" She tells you which of your habits it is following: the way you win.",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "task-force",
        "amount": 1
       },
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "ub-appetite-told",
        "amount": 1
       },
       {
        "kind": "item",
        "id": "beast-ball",
        "count": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "label": "\"What's coming?\"",
     "success": {
      "text": "Looker lays out three photographs: three Beasts it could be. He taps one, then another, then shrugs. \"One of them is right.\"",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "task-force",
        "amount": 1
       },
       {
        "kind": "item",
        "id": "beast-ball",
        "count": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "label": "\"I don't need your help.\"",
     "success": {
      "text": "Looker: \"No one does. Until.\" He leaves the Ball on the table anyway.",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "ub-refused-help",
        "amount": 1
       },
       {
        "kind": "item",
        "id": "beast-ball",
        "count": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
